  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance to Internally Displaced Persons in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In response to the crisis in Yemen, IOM is providing multi-sectoral humanitarian assistance within the following sectors of assistance: health, coordination and safety, food security, water, sanitation and hygiene, shelter, camp coordination and camp management, non-food items, and emergency employment and community rehabilitation, and multi-sectoral assistance for migrants.</narrative>
  </description>
